Hi {Owner},

I build websites and bid tools for commercial general contractors around {City}. On the {Business Name} site I couldn't find project facts by sector, a prequalification pack an owner can request, or a place for subcontractors to register and see open bid packages.

I built a sample before asking for your time: project pages by sector with size, delivery method and schedule, a preconstruction section, an owner prequalification pack, a subcontractor plan room and project leadership profiles, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, changes and new projects. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and your BD lead work this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
